name: ['Bull Elephant', 'Dark Privilege', 'King Cheetah', 'Necrosavant', 'Ovinomancer', 'Peace Talks', 'Urborg Mindsucker', 'Vampirism', 'Viashino Sandstalker', 'Wicked Reward']
